    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM Auctioneers are delighted to introduce to the market this charming traditional style two-bedroom bungalow, set on approximately 0.5 acre, situated less than 3 km from Castletown Village and within a 10-minute drive of Bruree.\n \nThis property offers bright, well-proportioned and comfortable accommodation. The layout comprises a porch, entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, two bedrooms and a shower room.\n\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable countryside home conveniently located close to local amenities and surrounding villages.\n\nThe grounds extend to approximately 0.5 acre and are bordered with timber fencing to the roadside with post and wire to the rear. The front of the property is laid out in gravel with ample car parking and the rear is laid out on grass. The property benefits from 2 storage sheds. The spacious steel tech shed, equipped with electricity, is ideal for a workshop space or other uses. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this property has to offer.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, contact Richard Ryan on 087 8067772.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 12'11\" (3.94m) x 5'9\" (1.75m)\nWith laminated wood floor.\n\nSitting Room - 13'2\" (4.01m) x 10'6\" (3.2m)\nWith marble fireplace and laminated wooden floor.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 14'0\" (4.27m) x 11'6\" (3.51m)\nWith laminated wooden floor, fitted units with oven, hob and extractor fan, solid fuel stove and plumbed for washing machine.\n\nBedroom No. 1 - 10'4\" (3.15m) x 10'7\" (3.23m)\nWith laminated wooden floor.\n\nBedroom No. 2 - 11'6\" (3.51m) x 9'0\" (2.74m)\nWith laminated wooden floor.\n\nBathroom - 7'4\" (2.24m) x 6'4\" (1.93m)\nFully tiled with toilet, wash hand basin, Triton T90 SR shower.\n\nShed - 10'0\" (3.05m) x 13'6\" (4.11m)\nHouses the water treatment unit (water softener) and the oil tank.\n\nSteel tech Shed - 26'0\" (7.92m) x 19'10\" (6.05m)\nWith roller door, concrete floor, non-drip cladding & electricity.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Oil fired central heating. </li><li> Solid fuel stove. </li><li> DG UPVC windows. </li><li> Well water. </li><li> Septic tank. </li><li> BER D</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D<br>BER No: 107176216<br>Energy Performance Indicator: 269.79 kWh/m2/yr"
