      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "At O`Rourkes Cross take the R518 sign posted for Ballingarry and Newcastle West. Continue on this road for approximately 6 kms. The property is on the left hand side. Co-ordinates: 52. 435737, -8.780392 or alternatively use Eircode V35 TX66."
      },
      {
